# A chair, canonically BACKED toward +x: seat at mid-height, back rising
# from it, four legs. Placing uses the look direction unrotated, so a chair
# dropped while facing +x has its back away and its seat turned toward the
# placer. The seat sits above AUTO_STEP_MAX, so a walk does not climb onto
# furniture.
version 1
shape chair
grid 12
states facing
box all  2 6 2   10 8 10   # seat
box all  8 8 2   10 12 10  # back
box all  2 0 2   4 6 4     # leg
box all  8 0 2   10 6 4    # leg
box all  2 0 8   4 6 10    # leg
box all  8 0 8   10 6 10   # leg
